    },
    {
      "ref": "1CH 11:6",
      "text": {
        "sourceId": "webp",
        "version": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceBook": "1CH",
        "sourceChapter": 11,
        "sourceVerse": 6,
        "canonical": {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 6
        },
        "text": "David had said, “Whoever strikes the Jebusites first shall be chief and captain.” Joab the son of Zeruiah went up first, and was made chief.",
        "textStatus": "present",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH11.htm#V6",
        "alignment": "preserved-from-pinned-fixed-source; not semantically reviewed"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH11.htm#V6",
      "witnessVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5"
    },
    {
      "ref": "1CH 11:39",
      "text": {
        "sourceId": "webp",
        "version": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceBook": "1CH",
        "sourceChapter": 11,
        "sourceVerse": 39,
        "canonical": {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 11,
          "verse": 39
        },
        "text": "Zelek the Ammonite, Naharai the Berothite (the armor bearer of Joab the son of Zeruiah),",
        "textStatus": "present",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH11.htm#V39",
        "alignment": "preserved-from-pinned-fixed-source; not semantically reviewed"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH11.htm#V39",
      "witnessVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5"
    },
    {
      "ref": "1CH 18:12",
      "text": {
        "sourceId": "webp",
        "version": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceBook": "1CH",
        "sourceChapter": 18,
        "sourceVerse": 12,
        "canonical": {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 18,
          "verse": 12
        },
        "text": "Moreover Abishai the son of Zeruiah struck eighteen thousand of the Edomites in the Valley of Salt.",
        "textStatus": "present",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH18.htm#V12",
        "alignment": "preserved-from-pinned-fixed-source; not semantically reviewed"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH18.htm#V12",
      "witnessVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5"
    },
    {
      "ref": "1CH 18:15",
      "text": {
        "sourceId": "webp",
        "version": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceBook": "1CH",
        "sourceChapter": 18,
        "sourceVerse": 15,
        "canonical": {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 18,
          "verse": 15
        },
        "text": "Joab the son of Zeruiah was over the army; Jehoshaphat the son of Ahilud was recorder;",
        "textStatus": "present",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH18.htm#V15",
        "alignment": "preserved-from-pinned-fixed-source; not semantically reviewed"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH18.htm#V15",
      "witnessVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5"
    },
    {
      "ref": "1CH 26:28",
      "text": {
        "sourceId": "webp",
        "version": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceBook": "1CH",
        "sourceChapter": 26,
        "sourceVerse": 28,
        "canonical": {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 26,
          "verse": 28
        },
        "text": "All that Samuel the seer, Saul the son of Kish, Abner the son of Ner, and Joab the son of Zeruiah had dedicated, whoever had dedicated anything, it was under the hand of Shelomoth and of his brothers.",
        "textStatus": "present",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH26.htm#V28",
        "alignment": "preserved-from-pinned-fixed-source; not semantically reviewed"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH26.htm#V28",
      "witnessVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5"
    },
    {
      "ref": "1CH 27:24",
      "text": {
        "sourceId": "webp",
        "version": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5",
        "sourceBook": "1CH",
        "sourceChapter": 27,
        "sourceVerse": 24,
        "canonical": {
          "book": "1CH",
          "chapter": 27,
          "verse": 24
        },
        "text": "Joab the son of Zeruiah began to take a census, but didn’t finish; and wrath came on Israel for this. The number wasn’t put into the account in the chronicles of King David.",
        "textStatus": "present",
        "citationURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH27.htm#V24",
        "alignment": "preserved-from-pinned-fixed-source; not semantically reviewed"
      },
      "sourceURL": "https://ebible.org/engwebp/1CH27.htm#V24",
      "witnessVersion": "webp-usfx-2026-10-13-35a6adf626e5"
    }
